  "title": "Sfouf (Lebanese Turmeric Cake)",
  "description": "This moist, sfouf Lebanese turmeric cake is a beautiful golden color thanks to ground turmeric. Anise seeds and anise seed powder lend flavor to the cake.",
  "authors": [
    "LauraF"
  ],
  "date_published": "2020-06-19T00:19:55-04:00",
